  "solution": "Xét từng đáp án\n\t\t<ul><li>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là dãy tăng.</li><li>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là dãy giảm.</li>